#: rc.cpp:16
msgid ""
"<b>Welcome to the Certificate Wizard!</b>\n"
"<br>\n"
"<br>\n"
"In a few easy steps, this wizard will help you to create a certificate. You "
"use your certificates in order to sign messages, to encrypt messages and to "
"decrypt messages that other people send to you in encrypted form.\n"
"<p>\n"
"The certificates will be generated in a decentralized manner. Please contact "
"your local help desk if you are unsure how to create a certificate in your "
"organization."
msgstr ""
"<b>Croeso i'r Dewin Tystysgrifau! </b>\n"
"<br> \n"
"<br> \n"
" Mewn rhai camau hawdd, bydd y dewin yma yn eich cymorthwyo i greu "
"tystysgrif.  Defnyddiwch eich tystysgrifau i lofnodi negeseuon, i amgryptio "
"negeseuon, ac i ddadgryptio negeseuon y mae pobl eraill yn anfon i chi mewn "
"ffurf cêl-ysgrifaeth.\n"
"<p>\n"
" Creuir y tystysgrifau mewn ffordd datganoledig.  Cysylltwch â'ch desg "
"cymorth lleol os nad ydych yn sicr am sut i greu tystysgrif yn eich corff. "

#: rc.cpp:17
msgid "Your Personal Data"
msgstr "Eich Data Personol"

#: rc.cpp:18
msgid "&Email address:"
msgstr "&Cyfeiriad ebost:"

#: rc.cpp:19
msgid "Enter your email address here"
msgstr "Rhowch eich cyfeiriad ebost yma"

#: rc.cpp:20
msgid ""
"Enter the email address here which you want to use in connection with the "
"certificate."
msgstr ""
"Rhowch y cyfeiriad ebost yr ydych eisiau ei ddefnyddio yng nghysylltiad a'r "
"tystysgrif."

#: rc.cpp:21
msgid "&Country code:"
msgstr "Côd &Gwlad:"

#: rc.cpp:22
msgid "&Name:"
msgstr "&Enw:"

#: rc.cpp:23
msgid "&Location:"
msgstr "&Lleoliad:"

#: rc.cpp:24
msgid "&Organization:"
msgstr "&Sefydliad:"

#: rc.cpp:25
msgid "&Department:"
msgstr "&Adran:"

#: rc.cpp:26
msgid "Enter your organization here"
msgstr "Rhowch eich sefydliad yma"

#: rc.cpp:27
msgid ""
"Enter your organization (e.g., your company, your department, or your "
"authority) here as it should appear on the certificate."
msgstr ""
"Rhowch eich corff (e.e., eich cwmni, eich adran, neu eich awdurdod) fel "
"dylai ymddangos ar y dystysgrif."

#: rc.cpp:28
msgid ""
"On this page, you will enter some personal data that will be stored in your "
"certificate and that will help other people to determine that it is actually "
"you who is sending a message."
msgstr ""
"Ar y dudalen hon, byddwch yn mewnosod data personol sy'n cael ei gadw yn "
"eich tystysgrif, sy'n cymorthyo i bobl eraill benderfynu mai chi sy'n anfon "
"neges."

#: rc.cpp:29
msgid "Enter your name here"
msgstr "Rhowch eich enw yma"

#: rc.cpp:30
msgid "Enter your name here as it should be shown in the certificate."
msgstr "Rhowch eich enw yma fel dylai ymddangos yn y dystysgrif."

#: rc.cpp:31
msgid "Decentralized Certificate Generation"
msgstr "Creu Tystygrifau Datganoledig"

#: rc.cpp:32
msgid ""
"On this page, you will create a certificate in a decentralized way. You can "
"either store the certificate in a file for later transmission or send it to "
"the Certificate Authority (CA) directly. Please check with your local help "
"desk if you are unsure what to select here."
"<br>Once you are done with your settings, click <em>Generate "
"Certificate</em> in order to generate your certificate."
msgstr ""
"Ar y dudalen yma, byddwch yn creu tystysgrif mewn ffordd datganoledig.  "
"Gallwch gadw'r dystysgrif mewn ffeil, i'w throsglwyddo yn nes ymlaen, neu ei "
"hanfon yn uniongyrchol i'r Awdurdod Tystysgrifau (CA).  Gofynnwch i'ch desg "
"cymorth lleol os ydych yn ansicr am beth i'w ddewis yma.  "
"<br>Ar ôl i chi orffen efo'ch fosodiadau, cliciwch <em>Creu Tystysgrif</em>"
" er mwyn creu eich tystysgrif."

#: rc.cpp:33
msgid "Certificate &Generation"
msgstr "&Creu Tysysgrif"

#: rc.cpp:34
msgid "&Store in a file:"
msgstr "&Cadw mewn ffeil:"

#: rc.cpp:35
msgid "Send to CA as an &email message:"
msgstr "Anfon i'r CA fel neges &ebost:"

#: rc.cpp:36
msgid "Add email to DN in request for broken CAs"
msgstr "Ychwanegu ebost i'r DN mewn cais am CAau sydd wedi'u torri"

#: rc.cpp:37
msgid "&Generate Certificate"
msgstr "&Cynhyrchu'r Dysysgrif"

#: rc.cpp:38
msgid "Your Certificate Is Ready To Be Sent"
msgstr "Mae'ch Tysysgrif yn Barod i'w Hanfon"

#: rc.cpp:39
msgid ""
"<qt>\n"
"Your signature key pair is now ready to be sent to the CA (certification "
"authority) which will generate a certificate for you and send it back via "
"email (unless you have selected storage in a file). Please review the "
"certificate shown below.\n"
"<p>\n"
"If you want to change anything, press Back and make your changes. Otherwise "
"press Finish to send the signature key pair to the CA.\n"
"</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>\n"
" Mae eich pâr allwedd llofnod yn barod i'w anfon i'r CA (awdurdod "
"tystysgrif), fydd yn creu tystysgrif i chi a'i dychwelyd mewn ebost (os nad "
"ydych wedi dewis ei chadw mewn ffeil).  Adolygwch y dystysgrif a ddangosir "
"isod. \n"
" <p>\n"
"  Os ydych eisiau newid rhywbeth, gwasgwch Yn Ôl  a gwnewch eich "
"newidiadau.  Fel arall, gwasgwch Gorffen i anfon y pâr allwedd llofnod i'r "
"CA. \n"
" </qt>"
